### 5. How to Push to GitHub
Once you have saved all the files in the structure above:

1.  Open your terminal in the `BrickForge-AI` folder.
2.  Run these commands:
    ```bash
    git init
    git add .
    git commit -m "Initial commit: BrickForge AI core + UI"
    git branch -M main
    git remote add origin https://github.com/YOUR_USERNAME/BrickForge-AI.git
    git push -u origin main
    ```

This gives you a clean, professional repository that looks like a serious software project rather than just a script dump.
